  "objectives": [
    "把 $a_n$ 寫成 $b_n-b_{n+1}$（或 $b_n-b_{n+k}$），寫出部分和、看出中間全部相消",
    "間隔是 $k$ 時，知道前面會留下 $k$ 項、後面會留下 $k$ 項",
    "相消之後還要取極限：$\\lim b_n$ 不存在時級數發散"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 中間全部消掉",
      "body": [
        "關鍵：每一項是兩個數的差",
        "寫出前 $N$ 項：",
        "只剩頭和尾："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n(n+1)}",
        "\\frac1{n(n+1)}=\\frac1n-\\frac1{n+1}",
        "s_N=\\Big(1-\\cancel{\\tfrac12}\\Big)+\\Big(\\cancel{\\tfrac12}-\\cancel{\\tfrac13}\\Big)+\\cdots+\\Big(\\cancel{\\tfrac1N}-\\tfrac1{N+1}\\Big)",
        "s_N=1-\\frac1{N+1}",
        "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n(n+1)}=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\Big(1-\\frac1{N+1}\\Big)=1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "① 一般的樣子",
      "body": [
        "$a_n=b_n-b_{n+1}$：",
        "收斂 ⇔ $\\lim b_n$ 存在"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "s_N=(b_1-b_2)+(b_2-b_3)+\\cdots+(b_N-b_{N+1})",
        "=b_1-b_{N+1}",
        "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(b_n-b_{n+1})=b_1-\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}b_{N+1}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 怎麼拆成差",
      "body": [
        "有理式：用部分分式（4.21）",
        "$n=0$：$A=1$；$n=-1$：$B=-1$",
        "再一個：$\\dfrac1{(2n-1)(2n+1)}$",
        "驗算：$\\frac1{2n-1}-\\frac1{2n+1}=\\frac{2}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}$，所以要乘 $\\frac12$",
        "$b_n=\\frac1{2n-1}$，$b_{n+1}=\\frac1{2n+1}$：剛好是相鄰的兩個"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac1{n(n+1)}=\\frac{A}{n}+\\frac{B}{n+1}",
        "1=A(n+1)+Bn",
        "=\\frac12\\Big(\\frac1{2n-1}-\\frac1{2n+1}\\Big)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 試一題",
      "body": [
        "根號：先有理化",
        "這裡的差是「後減前」：$b_{n+1}-b_n$，消法一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac1{\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt n}=\\frac{\\sqrt{n+1}-\\sqrt n}{(n+1)-n}=\\sqrt{n+1}-\\sqrt n",
        "s_N=(\\sqrt2-1)+(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)+\\cdots+(\\sqrt{N+1}-\\sqrt N)",
        "=\\sqrt{N+1}-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 間隔不是 1",
      "body": [
        "這次兩項差 2：$\\frac1{n-1}$ 要等兩項後才被消掉",
        "前面留下 2 項：$1+\\frac12$",
        "後面留下 2 項：$-\\frac1N-\\frac1{N+1}$",
        "驗算：$N=5$：$\\frac13+\\frac18+\\frac1{15}+\\frac1{24}=\\frac{17}{30}=\\frac12\\big(\\frac32-\\frac15-\\frac16\\big)$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n^2-1}=\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac12\\Big(\\frac1{n-1}-\\frac1{n+1}\\Big)",
        "\\begin{aligned}n=2&:\\ 1-\\tfrac13\\\\n=3&:\\ \\tfrac12-\\tfrac14\\\\n=4&:\\ \\tfrac13-\\tfrac15\\\\n=5&:\\ \\tfrac14-\\tfrac16\\\\&\\ \\ \\vdots\\end{aligned}",
        "s_N=\\frac12\\Big(1+\\frac12-\\frac1N-\\frac1{N+1}\\Big)",
        "\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n^2-1}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac32=\\frac34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 間隔 $k$：留 $k$ 項",
      "body": [
        "$a_n=b_n-b_{n+k}$：",
        "這裡 $n$ 從 $1$ 開始；從別的指標開始，頭的 $k$ 項就從那裡數",
        "不確定就寫出來：寫 $4$、$5$ 行就看得出誰消誰"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "s_N=(b_1+\\cdots+b_k)-(b_{N+1}+\\cdots+b_{N+k})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 一定要經過部分和",
      "body": [
        "錯的想法：「中間都消掉了，和就是頭的 $\\ln1=0$」",
        "尾巴 $b_{N+1}=\\ln(N+1)$ 沒有極限，不會消失",
        "會相消 ≠ 會收斂：相消之後還要取極限"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\ln\\frac{n}{n+1}\\ \\text{收斂嗎？}",
        "\\ln\\frac{n}{n+1}=\\ln n-\\ln(n+1)",
        "s_N=\\ln1-\\ln(N+1)=-\\ln(N+1)",
        "-\\ln(N+1)\\to-\\infty\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\text{發散}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• $a_n=b_n-b_{n+1}$ ⇒ $s_N=b_1-b_{N+1}$",
        "• 拆法：部分分式、$\\ln$ 的商、根號有理化",
        "• 間隔 $k$：頭留 $k$ 項、尾留 $k$ 項（不確定就寫出來）",
        "• 和 $=$ 頭 $-$ 尾巴的極限；尾巴沒有極限就發散",
        "• $\\sum\\frac1{n(n+1)}=1$，$\\sum\\frac1{n^2-1}=\\frac34$，$\\sum\\ln\\frac n{n+1}$ 發散",
        "下一課：發散判別"
      ]
    }
